<At levels="standard deep">

The last chapter ended with vectors: lists of numbers for each token. What does the model do with
them? It feeds them through millions of tiny calculators called <GlossaryPopover term="neuron">neurons</GlossaryPopover>. Each one is simple enough to work out by
hand. Move the sliders and watch the numbers flow.

